A new release, v.0.16.1, of CK-ERP, has been posted at SourceForge.Net,
http://sourceforge.net/projects/ck-erp .

New features include,
1.Connector for Xaraya 1.0.1
2.Performance improvement on the i18n module (mass generation and
deletion of translation phrases no longer carry the usual audit trail
information).

Special thank is due to Marc Lutolf for spotting errors in the German
translation and for numerous advice on the Xaraya connector.

CK-ERP is an open source accounting/ERP/CRM system that runs on top of
eGroupWare / Xaraya / Horde / TikiWiki / phpBB.  It comprises 20
modules - Administration, i18n, Contact Management, Customer
Relationship, Customer Self Service, Vendor Relationship, Ledger, Bank
Reconciliation, Inventory, Service, AP, AR, PO, SO, Quotation, POS for
Cashier, POS for Manager, HR, Staff Self Service and Payroll.
Operating platform can either be LAMP or LAPP.  It provides accounting
and back office functionalities to SMEs and utilizes the underlying
middleware to administer accounts/groups.  Please report error and
suggestion to the discussion group / mailing list,
CK-ERP-en(at)googlegroups.com or CK-ERP-zh_CN(at)googlegroups.com .
General history and expected development is available at the discussion
group's Archive.

Latest tested working environment:
FC4, Apache 2.0.54, Postgres 8.0.3 / MySQL 4.1.11, eGroupWare 1.2RC4
FC4, Apache 2.0.54, Postgres 8.0.3 / MySQL 4.1.11, Xaraya 1.0.1
FC4, Apache 2.0.54, Postgres 8.0.3 / MySQL 4.1.11, Horde 3.0.8
FC4, Apache 2.0.54, Postgres 8.0.3 / MySQL 4.1.11, TikiWiki 1.9.2
FC4, Apache 2.0.54, MySQL 4.1.11, phpBB 2.0.18

